- [ ] Rotate secrets before deployment
- [ ] Make sure secrets are encrypted at rest
- [ ] Verify secrets are not exposed in error messages
- [ ] Configure audit logging for secret access

### Post-Deployment
- [ ] Set up alerts for suspicious secret access patterns
- [ ] Monitor for secret leaks in logs
- [ ] Review secrets regularly (mark old secrets for rotation)
- [ ] Document which secrets are used where
